# Design Language

Source: visual system of teta.co.com, mapped to this project's stack.
Never hardcode brand hex in component CSS. Always use these variable names.

## Color tokens

```css
:root {
  --color-primary: #0a105a;
  --color-secondary: #5078a9;
  --color-text: #091426;
  --color-accent: #091426;
  --color-muted: #3a414d;
  --color-white: #ffffff;
  --color-bg: #f5f5f5;
  --color-border: #dbdbdb;
  --color-border-soft: #e1e1e1;
  --color-overlay: rgba(9, 20, 38, 0.55);
  --color-blur: rgba(80, 120, 169, 0.3);
  --color-glass: rgba(217, 217, 217, 0.16);
}
```

## Typography

```css
:root {
  --font-family-base: "Vazirmatn", "IRANSansX", Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif;
  --font-family-heading: "Vazirmatn", "IRANSansX", Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif;
  --font-size-hero: 2.25rem;
  --font-size-section: 1.5rem;
  --font-size-card: 0.9375rem;
  --font-size-body: 0.875rem;
  --font-size-meta: 0.8125rem;
  --font-size-button: 0.875rem;
  --line-height-body: 1.875rem;
  --font-weight-regular: 400;
  --font-weight-medium: 500;
  --font-weight-semibold: 600;
  --font-weight-bold: 700;
}
```

Headings use `--font-family-heading` and `--color-accent`. Body copy uses `--font-family-base` and `--color-text`.

Type scale: hero 36–40px (`--font-size-hero`), section 24–28px (`--font-size-section`), card title 15–17px (`--font-size-card`), body 14–16px (`--font-size-body`), meta 13px (`--font-size-meta`), buttons 14px medium (`--font-size-button`). `--color-muted` stays dark enough for contrast on white and `--color-bg`.

## Radius and elevation

```css
:root {
  --radius-sm: 4px;
  --radius-md: 6px;
  --radius-lg: 8px;
  --radius-xl: 12px;
  --shadow-card: 0 4px 18px rgba(9, 20, 38, 0.06);
  --shadow-header: 0 2px 12px rgba(9, 20, 38, 0.04);
}
```

Buttons: `--radius-md`. Cards and inputs: `--radius-lg` or `--radius-xl`. Product cards: `--radius-xl`.

## Layout

```css
:root {
  --container-max: 1344px;
  --space-section: 3rem;
  --header-height: 78px;
}
```

Page background is `--color-bg`. Surfaces (header, cards, search) are `--color-white`. Primary navy blocks use `--color-primary`. Action blue is `--color-secondary`.

## Component feel

- Header: white bar, 46px logo, icon+label nav, compact icon buttons
- Product cards: white, 12px radius, image, code, title, compatibility, brand, wholesale CTA
- Section titles: navy bar, white heading, square icon tile
- Search: white panel, icon-prefixed selects, secondary search button
- Footer: white, three contact tiles, link columns, copyright row
